          "type": "h2",
          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A serviced office provider in Dublin with several buildings and a website that global coworking brands outranked on every search."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "'Office space Dublin' was owned by international brands with enormous budgets. The provider's buildings were better located and cheaper, and nobody searching could find that out."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "A page per building, each with its own Google Business Profile, photos and reviews",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Local SEO for every 'office space' plus area search in the city",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Google Ads on long-tail searches the big brands ignored: 'private office for 6 Dublin 2'",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Tour booking landing pages with live availability",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Monthly review requests to existing tenants",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Tour bookings tripled in eight months and the cost per booked tour fell 44%."
        }
      ]
    },
